  "description": "Operating Area: Naples, Sorrento, Italy, Olbia, Sardinia\n\nCustom Line Navetta 33 DIANA II is a luminous equilibrium of beauty that glides over the water. She offers expansive exterior spaces and a bulbous bow that ensures best-in-class stability.\n\nAccommodating up to 11 guests, the yacht features 5 spacious en-suite cabins: a Master suite on the main deck, 3 double cabins, and 1 twin cabin (one with a Pullman) on the lower deck.\n\nThe sun deck features a Jacuzzi and sun loungers aft, with a shaded central area furnished with sofas and a coffee table. The upper deck offers complete privacy and provides al fresco dining around a large table. Additionally, guests can relax on the comfortable seating areas at the bow or stern. Inside, the main salon offers ample lounge space and abundant natural light.\n\nDIANA II includes a large swim platform for easy access to the water, stabilizers, and a wide array of water toys. An experienced crew of 6 ensures a seamless yachting experience.\n\nShe is equipped with Starlink high speed internet.",
